00:05:04,704 --> 00:05:21,144
A marijuana delivery operator or delivery operator means an entity licensed to purchase at wholesale and warehouse finished marijuana products acquired from a marijuana cultivator, marijuana product manufacturer, microbusiness, or craft marijuana cooperative.

44
00:05:22,085 --> 00:05:37,118
and white label, sell, and deliver finished marijuana products, marijuana accessories, and marijuana branded goods directly to consumers, but is not authorized to repackage marijuana or marijuana products or operate a storefront under this license.

45
00:05:37,939 --> 00:05:40,702
A delivery operator is an additional license type

46
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:48,623
which allows for limited delivery of marijuana or marijuana products to consumers and shall not be considered to be a retailer.

47
00:05:48,643 --> 00:06:00,407
A delivery operator is authorized to sell finished products directly to consumers and a delivery operator shall register as a vendor with the Department of Revenue and collect and remit marijuana.

