78
00:09:27,771 --> 00:09:34,618
The COVID-19 pandemic has shined a light on how much consumers value the service of items being delivered to their doorstep.

79
00:09:35,298 --> 00:09:41,404
Kindly, Delivery understands that cannabis home delivery is the next frontier in this burgeoning recreational industry.

80
00:09:42,205 --> 00:09:47,830
It can be the safest option for those who might not be able to visit a retail store due to health concerns like COVID.

81
00:09:48,811 --> 00:09:59,097
Although the stigma is fading, consumers value the ability to be discreet in their cannabis use and appreciate that delivery is simply the most personalized and convenient way to shop for busy adults.

82
00:09:59,877 --> 00:10:07,722
Cannabis has been delivered through medical dispensaries to patients since April of 2017 with great ease, success, and without incident.

83
00:10:08,642 --> 00:10:13,426
With home delivery, there is minimal risk of post-purchase public consumption.

84
00:10:14,087 --> 00:10:19,351
It encourages safe private consumption at home and reduces the likelihood of impaired driving.

85
00:10:20,372 --> 00:10:28,379
Home delivery can also reduce the traffic impacts and nuisances associated with dispensaries that are often concerns of abutters and residents.

86
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:35,285
